    <item>
     <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout" stretch="0,0">
      <item>
       <widget class="QLabel" name="label">
        <property name="text">
         <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Ubuntu'; font-size:16pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:20pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Start / Stop Mode Tutorial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot; margin-top:18px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:xx-large; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Move the Trolley&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Ring the bell twice.  This signals everyone that you are starting the trolley.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;H2&gt;Steps to move the trolley&lt;/H2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;We are going to start simple.  Click &amp;quot;+&amp;quot; to move the controller to Run1, count 5, then move the handle back to Run0 by clicking &amp;quot;-&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;If you leave the handle in Run1 too long it overheats the resistors and damages the trolley.  It also stops the simulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;So:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound the bell twice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;quot;+&amp;quot; to start the trolley&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Count 5&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;quot;-&amp;quot; to turn off the power&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Note: The trolley will continue to roll as you have not applied the brakes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;##image &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
